{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#card-zh","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 是面向 DSH Web 的移动端界面插件：在不替换聊天内容的情况下，把窄屏三栏框架改为侧边栏与聊天页组成的横向滑动分页，并保留完整展开的侧边栏。用户可以滑动切换页面、点击露出的聊天卡片返回，也可在选中会话后自动回到聊天页。插件还适配安全区与虚拟键盘、触控尺寸、设置对话框和长模型名称显示，并对滚动分页提供 3D 翻页效果及停稳吸附。适合通过手机或窄屏浏览器访问 DSH Web 的用户；通过 DSH 插件机制安装，无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:32-59","src/client/controller.ts:230-303","src/client/mobile.css:99-254","src/client/mobile.css:658-802"]}
{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#card-en","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Mobile makes DSH Web easier to use on phones with a swipeable sidebar and chat pager. It returns to chat after session selection and adapts the composer to safe areas, keyboards, and long model names. Install as a DSH plugin; no key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:32-59","src/client/controller.ts:230-303","src/client/mobile.css:99-254","src/client/mobile.css:658-802"]}
