{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#feature-1","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「侧边栏与聊天分页」：在 768px 及以下把主框架变为横向滚动吸附分页，侧边栏页与聊天页可滑动切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/mobile.css:99-131","src/client/controller.ts:494-539"]}
{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#feature-2","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「会话后返回聊天」：选择会话导致当前会话变化时，控制器平滑滚回聊天页；手机上会短暂抑制自动输入焦点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:48-54","src/client/controller.ts:177-189","src/client/controller.ts:551-566"]}
{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#feature-3","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「安全区与键盘适配」：读取 visualViewport 变化计算键盘 inset，并与设备安全区一起为固定输入区域留出空间。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/controller.ts:621-637","src/client/mobile.css:29-50","src/client/mobile.css:236-240"]}
{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#feature-4","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「移动输入栏排版」：为窄屏固定工具按钮尺寸、压缩权限选择器，并在模型名溢出时显示循环跑马灯。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/mobile.css:256-375","src/client/controller.ts:649-712"]}
{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#feature-5","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「移动端设置窗口」：把设置对话框改为带边距的单列卡片，将导航选项变成可横向滚动的标签栏。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/mobile.css:658-781"]}
{"unit_id":"lehhair__dsh-mobile#feature-6","repo":"lehhair/dsh-mobile","commit":"1144e6b98419010588cb01a207dfb1b33035ca9f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「聊天页翻转效果」：拖动分页时控制器按滚动进度更新聊天卡片旋转、缩放和偏移，停止后吸附到整页。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/controller.ts:494-539","src/client/mobile.css:176-209"]}
